 "words": 232,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "On the night before the Passover, the supper on the board",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 5.0,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The one who came from God and was going back to God",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 5.1,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Rose up from the table and he laid his robe aside",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 4.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Took a towel and a basin and he tied the cloth around",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 3.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He knelt before the fishermen with dust upon their feet",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 2.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He washed them one by one and dried them with the towel he wore",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 2.89,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He came to Simon Peter, who pulled his feet away",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 2.27,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "You shall never wash my feet",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 2.08,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Unless I wash you, you have no share with me",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Lord, then not only my feet, but my hands and my head as well",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 1.99,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "I have given you an example",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So that you also should do as I have done for you",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You also ought to wash one another's feet",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "As I have done for you",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Having loved his own who were in the world",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 2.29,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He loved them to the very end",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You call me Teacher and Lord, and you are right",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "No servant is greater than his master",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "If you know these things, you are blessed when you do them",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I have given you an example",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 5.92,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "So that you also should do as I have done for you",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "You also ought to wash one another's feet",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.84,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "As I have done for you",
   "heard": 6,
